%% alt: Sequence diagram. Your script asks the school registry API for a page of schools. While the API answers 429 Too Many Requests the script waits and asks again, at most three times. On 200 OK the JSON text becomes Python dicts and then a pandas DataFrame; on any other status the script raises an error and keeps no partial data.
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant S as Your script
  participant A as School API
  participant J as Python dicts
  participant P as pandas
  S->>+A: GET /schools?page=1
  loop while 429, at most 3 tries
    A-->>S: 429 Too Many Requests
    Note over S: sleep a few seconds
    S->>A: GET /schools?page=1 (again)
  end
  alt status 200 OK
    A-->>-S: JSON text
    S->>J: json.loads(text)
    J-->>S: list of dicts
    S->>P: pd.DataFrame(records)
    P-->>S: one row per school
  else any other status
    A-->>S: error body
    Note over S: raise an error, keep no partial data
  end
